```
- FIX: certain and surgical; appears in `_edits.json`.
- ADJUDICATE: a real concern needing a judgement. Describe the options in
  `truth`. Not edited.
- NOTE: worth recording, not worth an edit (LOW only).

### `_edits.json` (array; only FIX findings)
